# Code and Data for "Structured Factor Regression with High-Dimensional Multimodal Data"

## Overview

This repository contains the R code and data for reproducing the simulation studies and real data analysis presented in the paper *Structured Factor Regression with High-Dimensional Multimodal Data*.

The repository includes the implementation of the proposed method, alternative methods for comparison, simulation experiments, and real data analysis.

